lock-body field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item\"><p>Tango Therapeutics is a biotechnology company dedicated to discovering novel drug targets and delivering the next generation of precision medicine for the treatment of cancer. Using an approach that starts and ends with patients, Tango leverages the genetic principle of synthetic lethality to discover and develop therapies that take aim at critical targets in cancer. This includes expanding the universe of precision oncology targets into novel areas such as tumor suppressor gene loss and their contribution to the ability of cancer cells to evade immune cell killing.</p></div>\n      \n</div>\n      \n  </div>\n</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"row small-up-1 medium-up-1 large-up-3\" data-equalizer=\"ltvvc7-equalizer\" data-equalize-on=\"large\" data-resize=\"zepi3s-eq\">\n        <div class=\"column\" data-equalizer-watch>\n      <div class=\"block-region-column1\"><div class=\"block-content--nir-lp-block block-content--nir-lp-block--6421 block--block-content1f893ff0-9cfd-44f0-b315-aef99d63f45f block--block-content1f893ff0-9cfd-44f0-b315-aef99d63f45f--5806 block--column1--block-content--1f893ff0-9cfd-44f0-b315-aef99d63f45f block--column1--block-content--1f893ff0-9cfd-44f0-b315-aef99d63f45f--5806 block--b127e841-f618-4bc5-b226-66d08f40405a block--b127e841-f618-4bc5-b226-66d08f40405a--5806 block block-block-content block-block-content1f893ff0-9cfd-44f0-b315-aef99d63f45f\">\n  \n    \n      \n            <div class=\"field field--name-field-nir-lp-block-node field--type-entity-reference field--label-hidden field__item\">  \n            <div class=\"field field--name-field-nir-lp-block-body field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item\"><img class=\"thumbnail\" alt=\"news pr banner\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"88dd0ec6-ad9d-4631-89c2-516246b81495\" src=\"/system/files-encrypted/nasdaq_kms/inline-images/Tango_FinancialNews1.png\"></div>\n      \n</div>\n      \n  </